Company Short Description:
ROSY SKY is the FIRST and Leading Employee Engagement Agency in Hong Kong, providing customized roadmap from strategic planning to project and event management services with a holistic approach to enhance Employee Experience (EX).

We focus on all-rounded Employee Engagement Initiatives, offering 4 Key Pillars on 
(1) Event Management & Production; 
(2) Internal Engagement Initiatives; 
(3) Team Building & Training; 
(4) Employer Branding, 
ranging from Annual Dinner, Regional Conference, Incentive Trip, Meeting, Team Building, Sustainability Week, etc. ROSY SKY successfully won a wide range of corporate clients, especially luxury brands, with 100% compliments and a high client retention rate. We are in Business for Clients Christian Dior, Gucci, Salvatore Ferragamo, Pandora, Swarovski, L'Oreal, Shiseido, AIA, HSBC, ABN AMRO, PayPal, China Mobile International, JOS, JLL, Towngas, HKTV, etc.

ROSY SKY empowers corporate to create connections and engagement with their employees; so as supporting event or meeting organizers to create bonding and networks with their participants. We are experienced in handling events from 50 to 5,000+ peoples, with high flexibility and adaptability to change based upon live situations. We recognize the needs of each busy client & connect everything seamlessly together. With our in-house experience designer, we can capture the tiniest idea from you and leverage our expertise and network to make it happen and present decently, landing your expectations to reality.
